cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FieldNeuroToolbox (FNT) in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "FieldNeuroToolbox (FNT)"
abstract: >-
  Open-source software for working with field neuroethology data: graphical tools for audio
  and ultrasonic vocalizations (including the Mask Audio Detector), video processing, tracking
  and behavioral scoring, ultra-wideband and RFID tracking, feeding devices, fiber photometry
  and imaging, in one desktop app that runs on an ordinary laptop.
authors:
